  "details": "An optional Dynamic chat box system based on proximity and maybe even add  a short message history if you click on the person you are talking to.\n\nSo how the Dynamic chat box system will work when you are talking/texting someone to the person that is nearby, this system will have a chat box appear on the screen even if you are looking away, you shouldn't have to worry about missing a message or constantly be looking up for the text bubble for someone you feel is having an important conversation, and having an even a short message history can be a massive life improvement.\n\nThanks for reading I feel the chat box needs a bit of a small overhaul and this would be good direction.",
